    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## The morning after an event\nAttendance is the strongest enrolment signal this business has,\nand GHL held it only as a tag. Splitting attended from no-show\nis what makes the next message worth sending: a replay to one\ngroup, a survey to the other.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "842532230239",
      "name": "1. The morning after an event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Replay to the absent, survey to the present\nOne message per person per event, decided by the attended flag.\nThe follow-up only goes out once: a second pass would find the\nsame event again the next morning, so the event is marked\nCOMPLETED as part of the same run.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "202817622889",
      "name": "2. Replay to the absent, survey to the present",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        640,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Send, then close the event\nNumbers are written back onto the event so 'did that topic\nwork' is a saved view rather than a spreadsheet someone builds\nby hand after the fact.",
        "height": 490,
        "width": 1520,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "148074978867",
      "name": "3. Send, then close the event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        160
      ]
    }
